SECTION | KEY | VALUE
----------------------------------------
# flow.pdl - the pet trainer as a layout-studio FLOW (ids: pet-trainer/<view>). Audit: layout_flow check. Drive by label: layout_flow press <view> "<label>" --pid <window pid>.
FLOW | id     | pet-trainer
FLOW | layout | pet-trainer.xhtpm
FLOW | nav    | nav.pdl
FLOW | verbs  | ops/pet_event.sh
FLOW | keys   | keybinds.pdl
FLOW | house  | ../..
VIEW | room       | the pet's house (fridge, bed, bath, door to the village)
VIEW | manage     | the party strip: six tii-monsters from the RPG Maker DB, pick one
VIEW | world      | the village, top down: the trainer walks (arrows via Interact), doors, NPC creatures
VIEW | worldparty | the village with the Player menu open: the trainer's inventory is the six tii-monsters
